Section 12. That UDC Section 6.5.7i is amended as follows: “Off-premise signs located on
private property, unless election or ideological or approved as part of a temporary use permit.”

Section 13. That this ordinance shall be in full force and effect upon its approval and publication.

FIRST READING:

SECOND READING:

